===============================================================================
Third-party software shipped with or invoked by NVMeter
===============================================================================

1. smartmontools (smartctl)
   - License: GPL-2.0-or-later
   - Upstream: https://www.smartmontools.org/
   - Source:   https://github.com/smartmontools/smartmontools

   NVMeter invokes the unmodified `smartctl` executable as a separate
   process and parses its JSON output. The released `.app` bundle embeds
   the unmodified `smartctl` binary for convenience. In compliance with
   GPL-2.0 §3, the full corresponding source code for the embedded
   smartctl version is available at the upstream URL above, and a copy
   of the GPL-2.0 license text is included in the `.app` bundle under
   `Contents/Resources/licenses/smartmontools-LICENSE.txt`.

2. GRDB.swift
